      "cooked": "<p>Playing Chrono-Ranger Best of Times against a group of mini-villains including La Capitan, I used a Temporal Grenade to destroy Stitch In Time, thinking this was a good idea.  When I went to undo it, an odd message appeared:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc\" title=\"Screenshot_20220226-073825\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220226-073825\" data-base62-sha1=\"fhRDlliwOLfyJJquMm0QMasLsi8\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6b25981edb0d52cf1d91b946194f56d62f9892dc_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220226-073825</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 92.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Just an odd little Easter Egg the Handelabra guys threw in there.  I wonder how many more of these little in-jokes are waiting to be discovered, apart from the ones we expect to find with Guise.</p>",
